{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02699","headline":"春晚看羣公朝还人爲八韵 · 陈子良","name":"春晚看羣公朝还人爲八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游子惜春暮，策杖出蒿莱。\n正直康庄晚，羣公谒帝回。\n履度南宫至，车从北阙来。\n珂影傍明月，笳声动落梅。\n迎风采旄转，照日绶花开。\n红尘掩鹤盖，翠柳拂龙媒。\n绮云临舞阁，丹霞薄吹台。\n轻肥宁所羡，未若反山隈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子良","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}